    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter our winter fairy tale, the world of cat people to find hidden elves having fun, winter sweets and other and other attrbutes of winter in enchanting snowy landscapes. Explore a cozy winter forest on the edge of town and a house with Santa's workshop.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337920/extras/e9d970774428e392774b192d22fcc61b.poster.avif?t=1754856026\" width=800 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337920/extras/e9d970774428e392774b192d22fcc61b.webm?t=1754856026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337920/extras/e9d970774428e392774b192d22fcc61b.mp4?t=1754856026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hidden Winter Things</strong> includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hidden Elves</strong> Quest : Find mischievous elves and delightful winter surprises hidden in every corner.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2 Hand-painted Winter Scenarios</strong>: Experience two enchanting locations with a beautiful glow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over 300 hidden items</strong>: Find elves, snowflakes, toys, candy, Santa envelopes and more. Can you find them all?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing winter tunes</strong>: Perfect for immersing yourself in the winter atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Looped location:</strong> You can rotate the scene endlessly in a circle as you like.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Would be very happy to be added to your wish list. This is our first game and for our small team it is very important. Thank you &lt;3</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337920/extras/ef0a6197d4ad2ad0bf46b61920957500.avif?t=1754856026\" width=800 height=198 /></span></p>",
